{
  "_doc": "Interest profile for the aging-macro paper monitor. Edit freely; the script never writes here. Scores: core terms are required for eligibility; title hits count double; boosts are additive. ALERT additionally requires a macro term and one quality signal (known WP series, top venue, tracked author, or LAC geography); low_venues take -4. weak_core_terms count toward the score but cannot alone carry a paper to ALERT. exclude_terms drop off-domain matches (agronomy, clinical) before scoring. A tracked-author hit waives the macro-term requirement for ALERT.",
